      "value": {
        "body": "A four-year pharmacy degree covering pharmaceutics, pharmacology, pharmaceutical chemistry and pharmacognosy. It leads to work in pharmaceutical companies, hospitals and pharmacies, and to an M.Pharm. It is regulated by the Pharmacy Council of India."
      }
